    "created_at": "2016-05-15T17:20:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-15T17:20:30Z",
    "body": "What is the use case for this? The OP only contains \"on the same principle as classList.\" But toggling a class has real-world uses, whereas I can't imagine any for toggling an event listener. Has anyone ever written code that does?\n",
